  "settingsFaqQ1": "What's included in the Free plan?",
  "settingsFaqA1": "The Free plan lets you browse short dramas, save favorites, and watch with standard streaming quality. Upgrade to Pro for ad-free watching, offline downloads, and VIP-only series.",
  "settingsFaqQ2": "What does Pro include?",
  "settingsFaqA2": "Pro unlocks ad-free watching, offline episode downloads, VIP-only series, high-quality streams, and unlimited watchlist space.",
  "settingsFaqQ3": "Can I download episodes to watch offline?",
  "settingsFaqA3": "Yes. Pro subscribers can download episodes to watch offline, on Wi-Fi or mobile data, depending on your settings.",
  "settingsFaqQ4": "Can I watch dramas from anywhere?",
  "settingsFaqA4": "Yes. Browse short dramas by genre and language, save your favorites, and jump back in anytime.",
  "settingsFaqQ5": "What audio quality is available?",
  "settingsFaqA5": "Free users get standard streaming quality. Pro includes high-quality streams for supported series and episodes.",
  "settingsFaqQ6": "Can I cancel anytime?",
  "settingsFaqA6": "Yes. You can cancel your subscription whenever you want. You'll keep Pro access until the end of your current billing period.",
  "settingsFaqQ7": "Do you offer refunds?",
  "settingsFaqA7": "If you run into an issue, contact us and we'll help. Refund eligibility can vary depending on usage and billing; we'll review requests case-by-case.",
  "settingsFaqQ8": "Can I switch plans later?",
  "settingsFaqA8": "Yes. You can upgrade or downgrade at any time. Changes take effect immediately or at the next billing cycle depending on the plan change.",
  "settingsFaqQ9": "How does VIP work?",
  "settingsFaqA9": "VIP unlocks every VIP-only series and episode while your subscription is active. New episodes appear in your library, and you can resume exactly where you left off.",
  "settingsFaqQ10": "How do playlists and presets work?",
  "settingsFaqA10": "Save series to your list, keep your favorites close, and keep your viewing history synced across sessions so you can continue where you stopped.",
  "settingsFaqQ11": "Which content is Pro-only?",
  "settingsFaqA11": "Some VIP-only series, offline downloads, ad-free watching, and high-quality streams require Pro. Free users can still explore most dramas and episodes.",
